@startuml to_be
title TO-BE (HLD round 1, 2026-09-11) — bounded-context modules on the Engine's IExtension\nArrow = dependency direction (only the target module's contracts/ may be imported)

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam wrapWidth 200

package "shell/ — Martin's Main (knows only IExtension + contracts/)" #LightGray {
  component "modules.py\nEXPLICIT module list\n(two-way guard against modules/ on disk)" as ModList
  component "surfaces/trading\n(default route)\n0 lines of business logic" as SurfTrading #LightYellow
  component "surfaces/dev_board\ngated by dev.mode\n+ probes slot" as SurfDev #LightYellow
  component "surfaces/settings\nsections slot" as SurfSettings #LightYellow
  component "cli/ — parser assembled from\ncli_command contributions" as Cli
}

package "core/ — the app's kernel policy" #LightGray {
  component "contracts/\nBoundedContextModule(IExtension)\nIContributionRegistry + descriptor\nICommandDispatcher · IEventPublisher · IConfigReader" as CoreContracts
  component "vo/ — Published Language\nTimeFrame · OrderSide · PositionSide\nMarketDataVenue · TradingVenue\nCurrency · MarketType · MarketData(candle)\nPositionSizing\n(rule: >=2 consumers in 2 modules)" as CoreVo
}

package "modules/ — bounded context" {
  component "market_data (Supporting)\ncontracts: IHistoricalKlines · ISymbolCatalog\nIMarketDataSync · IMarketStream · IRangeCoverage\nevents: MarketTick · SingleSyncProgress\n---\ndomain/ application/ adapters/(persistence, binance/market) ui/(Data Management, cli sync|stream)" as MD #LightGreen
  component "trading (Supporting — Supplier)\ncontracts: IOrderSubmission · ITradingSession(.claim_symbol)\nIAccountSnapshot\nevents: OrderFilled · PositionChanged · PositionClosed\nEquitySampled · TradingSessionChanged\nDTO: PositionSnapshot (LivePosition NEVER leaves)\n---\nowns: TradingSessionState · PositionRefreshService\nwidgets: positions · open orders · manual order · session\ndev_probes/exchange_api_tester · 3 cli commands" as TR #LightGreen
  component "strategy (CORE)\ncontracts: IStrategyCatalog · IStrategyEngineFactory\nStrategyContext (neutral)\nevents: SignalGenerated · StrategyArmed/Disarmed · LiveOrderBlocked\n---\nowns: LiveStrategySession · LiveTradingCoordinator\nMarketTickEventHandler · arm/disarm\nwidgets: strategy card · last signal · params dialog · overlay\ncli trade-once" as ST #Gold
  component "backtesting (Supporting)\ncontracts: (no public port yet)\n---\nPaperExchange · _OpenPosition (NOT merged with LivePosition)\nACL: PaperExchange -> StrategyContext\nbacktest screen, 60 files" as BT #LightGreen
}

package "support/ — Generic (no business language)" {
  component "binance_gateway\nIExchangeSessionFactory · ITradingSessionFactory\nIExchangeCredentialsProvider · endpoints · error translator\n(the ONLY place that constructs binance.client.Client)" as GW
  component "charting\nIChartHost · MarkerPoint · RegionSpan · InfoField\nChartCard — QtWidgets FOREVER" as CH
  component "indicators\nIIndicatorCatalog · IIndicator\npure indicator maths, script runner" as IND
  component "ui_kit\nkit · qml/kit · DataTable · tokens\nActionOwnershipTracker · BaseFeed" as KIT
}

package "Engine (mechanism — knows nothing of the app)" #WhiteSmoke {
  component "IExtension · ExtensionDescriptor\nExtensionManager (topo-sort, fail-fast, rollback)" as Ext
  component "IContainer · IEventBus · QtEventBridge\nIDispatcher · Scheduler · HostedServiceManager" as Kern
  component "PresenterManager (QStackedWidget)\n+ ScreenRegistry (EPIC-016, app) — until Phase 4" as Nav
  component "EPIC-001D / TASK-043 (Phase 5)\nNavigationService (USER_INTENT vs RESTORE, can_leave)\nslot registry as models · screen lifecycle + conformance\ncreate_quick_widget(import_paths=) · generalised import_boundary" as Nav2 #Pink
}

' --- dependency direction between modules ---
ST --> MD : IHistoricalKlines\nMarketTickEvent
ST --> TR : IOrderSubmission\nITradingSession.claim_symbol\nIAccountSnapshot
BT --> MD : IHistoricalKlines\nIMarketDataSync · IRangeCoverage
BT --> ST : IStrategyCatalog\nIStrategyEngineFactory\nStrategyContext
TR --> MD : IHistoricalKlines · IMarketStream\nIMarketDataSync (chart)

MD --> GW
TR --> GW
TR ..> CH : draws fill markers via IChartHost
ST ..> CH : overlay
ST ..> IND
BT ..> CH
BT ..> IND

MD --> CoreVo
TR --> CoreVo
ST --> CoreVo
BT --> CoreVo
MD --> CoreContracts
TR --> CoreContracts
ST --> CoreContracts
BT --> CoreContracts

CoreContracts ..> Ext : BoundedContextModule extends IExtension
ModList --> Ext : app.use(module) in topological order

' --- a surface only hangs widgets that modules contribute ---
TR ..> SurfTrading : contributes surface_widget
TR ..> SurfDev : contributes surface_widget + dev_probe
ST ..> SurfTrading
ST ..> SurfDev
MD ..> SurfDev : system controls · picker
IND ..> SurfDev : script checklist
TR ..> SurfSettings : settings_section
MD ..> SurfSettings : settings_section
MD ..> Cli : cli_command
TR ..> Cli
ST ..> Cli

note bottom of TR #LightYellow
  The TR <-> ST cycle is resolved with a concept that BELONGS TO trading:
  the symbol lease (claim_symbol/release_symbol). trading does not know who claimed.
end note

note right of Nav2
  The Engine receives mechanism, the app keeps policy (contribution kinds,
  the module list, the dev.mode gate). Every new Engine API ->
  one RequiredEngineCapability line (BOT-133).
end note

note as Guards #LightGreen
  **3 AST guards** (tests/unit/architecture/):
  test_module_boundaries — allowlist may ONLY SHRINK (ratchet)
  test_module_domain_is_qt_free
  test_module_declarations — two-way list, dependencies == real imports,
  register() never resolve()s, no double DI claim
  Sanity: 0 new tests.
end note

@enduml
